## Model card

- **Name:** Neomorph
- **Short description:** OpenCode Zen experimental text model described in local metadata as having a modular sub-network architecture with a focus on structured outputs.
- **Provider / access:** Listed in local OpenCode/Zen model metadata as `opencode/neomorph`; public provider/model documentation for this exact ID was not found in sources reviewed.
- **Release / knowledge:** Experimental listing; release date and knowledge cutoff not publicly verified.
- **IDs:** `opencode/neomorph`.
- **Context window:** 64,000 total; 4,096 max output (per local meta).
- **Modalities:** Text in/out (per local meta).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** $0.50 / $1.50 per 1M input/output tokens (per local meta/provider documentation note).
- **Architecture:** Not publicly disclosed beyond local description of modular sub-network architecture.

